become increasingly effective in solving text-generation tasks,\\nby taking numeracy\\nin natural language (NL) instructions from users and outputting NL responses,\\nsuch35223\\nas answering\\nthe \u201cWhat is the capital of the US?\u201d with \u201cWashington D.C.\u201d. However,\\nx 186 / 77 = ?\\nLMs often struggle to perform tasks that require complex skills (e.g., math or complex reasoning), and are fundamentally unable to solve other tasks that require access to information\\nnot included in their training data (e.g., the current weather or date).\\nfacilitate\\n\\narXiv:2403.15452v1 [cs.CL] 18 Mar 2024\\n\\nAbstract\\n\\nTo solve this problem,\\nresearchers and practitionreal\\nreal\\nextend\\ncloudy with tools, which\\ners are\\nturning\\nto\\nLMs\\nenhanced\\nworld\\nworld\\n3\\nd\\nexten\\npm\\nhelp facilitate the task-solving process of LMs, or\\nget_time()\\ncheck_weather\\nextend LMs with\\nnew abilities that the LM does not\\npossess otherwise\\n(Qin et al., 2023; Mialon et al.,\\n(35.223 x 1.6)\u00b2 / 7 = ?\\n(35.223 x 1.6)\u00b2 / 7 = ?\\n2023).\\nFor\\nexample,\\na calculator tool may be basic\\nbasic\\ncalculator\\ncalculator', command='pdftotext /workspace/survey.pdf - | head -100', observation=<ObservationType.RUN: 'run'>, metadata=CmdOutputMetadata(exit_code=0, pid=-1, username='root', hostname='ecs-d984', working_dir='/workspace', py_interpreter_path='/openhands/poetry/openhands-ai-5O4_aCHf-py3.12/bin/python', prefix='', suffix='\\n[The command completed with exit code 0.]'), hidden=False), CmdRunAction(command='\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\npdftotext /workspace/survey.pdf - | grep -i \"figure 2\\\\|figure 3\\\\|figure 4\"\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n', is_input=False, thought='Let me search for the figures in the PDF more specifically:', blocking=False, is_static=False, cwd=None, hidden=False, action=<ActionType.RUN: 'run'>, confirmation_state='confirmed', security_risk=None), CmdOutputObservation(content='related works adopt (Figure 2). Assuming an LM\\nstarts w